(For binary search in a sorted array arr[0..n-1], the loop invariant is: If the target element x exists anywhere within the original) Tj
T* (array, it MUST lie within the sub-index range [low, high]. At each iteration, mid = low + \(high - low\)/2 divides the search space.) Tj
